                                "sense_id": "b5c3bd21-5984-37f8-babe-eb825984b890",
                                "text": "But the importance of the railways as main arteries of the national economy remains undimmed, just as their fascination for the railway enthusiast is surely undiminished."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e02c6415-c02e-4a6c-8c73-cc4f8690327f",
                                "sense_id": "b5c3bd21-5984-37f8-babe-eb825984b890",
                                "text": "As I studied the songs that Kaczerginsky had compiled, I was struck not only by the pathos, sadness, and helpless feelings of authors both known and unknown, but also by the often undimmed spirit, hopefulness, and visions of a brighter future."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
